build.summary:
I built the finish-of-study step for diag-study-report. Pressing "Finish study" now opens a study report over the live monitor, in every mode. The reference monitor stays visible for the stored runs and the learner's own QCA, and in guided mode the attending drawer opens with the finish-phase tips. In the report the learner:
- assigns each of the 5 LV walls to an artery and the injection that showed it, to a graft from the operation note, or to "none seen";
- gives the dominance;
- gives, for the left main, each artery and each graft: patency, worst stenosis (by eye or own QCA), SYNTAX segment, best run, and whether the narrowing was spasm that resolved with nitrate;
- marks runs as non-diagnostic and grades LV and valves (both recorded only, not checked against the case);
- classifies the MI when the case is an acute coronary syndrome (fifth universal definition);
- chooses no PCI, ad hoc PCI, heart team or staged PCI, and ticks which of Brilakis's 9 reasons to defer apply;
- names the PCI target (vessel, AngioCAD segment, own QCA, length) for ad hoc or staged PCI, and optionally for the heart team.

Nothing on the form comes from the case truth. The truth is built only on submission, from the case, the patient engine's coronary regions, the tree's segments and the stored runs. The store keeps the report, its comparison and the PciTarget, then finishes the case.

src/mentor/report.ts adds the comparison (built on the existing compareReport), the PciTarget builder and validator, the finish events and contexts, and the report's gaps. Every rule cites its lesson or is marked MODEL PARAMETER. src/mentor/debriefChecks/report.ts registers those gaps with the debrief (id study-report), and the new "Study report" debrief tab shows the full comparison with lesson links. Opening the report sets the phase to finish. An empty wall raises territory-unsupplied, plus anomalous-origin in an anomalous-origin case, and a CTO case raises cto.

Two plan items are not done because they need files outside this package. The four scenarios the plan names do not exist. The anomalous-circumflex anatomy cannot be drawn yet either. Instead, the launch file adds two links to existing scenarios that already work for the report.

